               "summary":  "SITM fell 10.83% to $361.24 on 2026-11-20 in a broad AI-chip selloff. That leaves it about 60% below its 52-week high and below all three EMAs, so the technical posture is bearish. RSI is 33.8, near oversold, and price sits on the lower Bollinger Band. The fundamentals point the other way: the Q3 beat on 2026-11-04 ($298.7M revenue, $4.01 EPS) and the Q4 guide of $331–341M show the AI-timing thesis is working, helped by the Renesas TPD deal. The moat thesis is intact. The stock\u0027s problem is sentiment and valuation, not the business."
